["i", 5, "That value is much lower than the food label (about 24 kJ per gram). What is the main reason, and the best improvement?", ["Much heat is lost to the air and the tube; use an insulated calorimeter close to the flame", "The peanut had no energy; use a new one", "The thermometer was wrong; use two", "The water was too cold; heat it first"], "Where else does the heat go?", "Most heat escapes to the surroundings, and burning may be incomplete. A calorimeter that traps the heat gives a value closer to the label."]
